{"id":"3f045a36dba6b5ef","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-bundle-classifying-data.md","title":"Bundle Pullbacks and Classifying Model Data","display":"df-bundle-classifying-data — Bundle Pullbacks and Classifying Model Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bundle-classifying-data","aliases":["58-df-bundle-classifying-data"],"display":"df-bundle-classifying-data — Bundle Pullbacks and Classifying Model Data","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]]","[[58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md]]","[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bundle-classifying-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bundle-classifying-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bundle-classifying-data — Bundle Pullbacks and Classifying Model Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97bfaddac2f220a7\" href=\"?note=97bfaddac2f220a7\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md\">../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc9d494c7bff68e\" href=\"?note=2bc9d494c7bff68e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" href=\"?note=e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" title=\"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md\">58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md\">../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F,X,Y,B,\\pi,q,\\tau_E,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\tau_B,h,f,b,n\\in V\">\\(E,F,X,Y,B,\\pi,q,\\tau_E,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\tau_B,h,f,b,n\\in V\\)</span>。所有复向量丛采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md\">../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md</a> 的固定纤维运算族，标量域为具有标准运算的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_n,T_n,\\tau_{G_n},\\tau_{T_n},\\pi_n^0\">\\(G_n,T_n,\\tau_{G_n},\\tau_{T_n},\\pi_n^0\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" href=\"?note=e5fc9ff70d8260ec\" title=\"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md\">58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md</a>。该族中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\pi_n^0)^{-1}[\\{P\\}]\">\\((\\pi_n^0)^{-1}[\\{P\\}]\\)</span> 的运算固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle P,v\\rangle+\\langle P,w\\rangle=\\langle P,v+w\\rangle\">\\(\\langle P,v\\rangle+\\langle P,w\\rangle=\\langle P,v+w\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\odot\\langle P,v\\rangle=\\langle P,av\\rangle\">\\(a\\odot\\langle P,v\\rangle=\\langle P,av\\rangle\\)</span>；等式按该纤维的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,w,a\">\\(v,w,a\\)</span> 全称量化。这些运算不由候选比较映射重选。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=x\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=x\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=e\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\langle x,e\\rangle)=e\\)</span>；二元积均使用有序对编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_A=\\{\\langle a,a\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_A=\\{\\langle a,a\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi)\">\\(\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullbackBundleProjection}_S(f,E,\\pi)\">\\(\\mathrm{PullbackBundleProjection}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in Y^E\">\\(\\pi\\in Y^E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span> 时使用；拓扑函数还要求所给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,E\">\\(X,E\\)</span> 为拓扑空间。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>为保留既有只显示总空间的三元兼容接口，固定一个丛记录族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr B\">\\(\\mathscr B\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr B(E)=\\langle\\pi,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r\\rangle_5\">\\(\\mathscr B(E)=\\langle\\pi,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r\\rangle_5\\)</span>，且每条记录满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BundleIsoOver}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BundleIsoOver}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 相对于此固定族解释；显式参数的谓词不另选或忘记给定投影。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle_r\">\\(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle_r\\)</span> 使用定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的函数编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr B\">\\(\\mathscr B\\)</span> 是具有集合定义域的函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinIso}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2bc9d494c7bff68e\" href=\"?note=2bc9d494c7bff68e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homotopic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homotopic}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md\">../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}\">\\(\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexBundleIsoData}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexBundleIsoData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalComplexBundleModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalComplexBundleModel}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Continuous}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Continuous}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,e\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}f\\times E:f(x)=\\pi(e)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,e\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}f\\times E:f(x)=\\pi(e)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullbackBundleProjection}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,e\\rangle,x\\rangle:\\langle x,e\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PullbackBundleProjection}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle x,e\\rangle,x\\rangle:\\langle x,e\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PullbackBundleTopology}_S(f,E,\\pi,\\tau_X,\\tau_E)\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\cap\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi):\nU\\in\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(\\operatorname{dom}f,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PullbackBundleTopology}_S(f,E,\\pi,\\tau_X,\\tau_E)\\coloneqq\n\\{U\\cap\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi):\nU\\in\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(\\operatorname{dom}f,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexBundleIsoData}_S(h,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,F,q,\\tau_F,X,\\tau_X,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nr\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(F,q,X,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,E,\\tau_E,F,\\tau_F)\\land q\\circ h=\\pi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\mathrm{LinIso}_{\\mathbb C}(h\\upharpoonright\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}],\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}],q^{-1}[\\{x\\}]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexBundleIsoData}_S(h,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,F,q,\\tau_F,X,\\tau_X,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nr\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(F,q,X,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,E,\\tau_E,F,\\tau_F)\\land q\\circ h=\\pi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\mathrm{LinIso}_{\\mathbb C}(h\\upharpoonright\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}],\\pi^{-1}[\\{x\\}],q^{-1}[\\{x\\}]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BundleIsoOver}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E,F,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nE,F\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\mathscr B\\land\n\\exists \\pi,q,\\tau_E,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,h\\in V\\;\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathscr B(E)=\\langle\\pi,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r\\rangle_5\n\\land\\mathscr B(F)=\\langle q,\\tau_F,X,\\tau_X,r\\rangle_5\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexBundleIsoData}_S(h,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,F,q,\\tau_F,X,\\tau_X,r)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BundleIsoOver}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(E,F,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nE,F\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\mathscr B\\land\n\\exists \\pi,q,\\tau_E,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,h\\in V\\;\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\mathscr B(E)=\\langle\\pi,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r\\rangle_5\n\\land\\mathscr B(F)=\\langle q,\\tau_F,X,\\tau_X,r\\rangle_5\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexBundleIsoData}_S(h,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,F,q,\\tau_F,X,\\tau_X,r)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}_S(h,F,q,\\tau_F,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nr\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(F,q,X,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,Y,\\tau_E,\\tau_Y,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,F,\\tau_F,\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi),\n\\mathrm{PullbackBundleTopology}_S(f,E,\\pi,\\tau_X,\\tau_E))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{PullbackBundleProjection}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\circ h=q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{LinIso}_{\\mathbb C}\n\\left(\\{\\langle v,\\operatorname{pr}_2(h(v))\\rangle:v\\in q^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\},\nq^{-1}[\\{x\\}],\\pi^{-1}[\\{f(x)\\}]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}_S(h,F,q,\\tau_F,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nr\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(F,q,X,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,Y,\\tau_E,\\tau_Y,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,F,\\tau_F,\\mathrm{PullbackBundleCarrier}_S(f,E,\\pi),\n\\mathrm{PullbackBundleTopology}_S(f,E,\\pi,\\tau_X,\\tau_E))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{PullbackBundleProjection}_S(f,E,\\pi)\\circ h=q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{LinIso}_{\\mathbb C}\n\\left(\\{\\langle v,\\operatorname{pr}_2(h(v))\\rangle:v\\in q^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\},\nq^{-1}[\\{x\\}],\\pi^{-1}[\\{f(x)\\}]\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UniversalComplexBundleModel}_S(B,\\tau_B,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,n,b)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,B,\\tau_E,\\tau_B,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(b,G_n,\\tau_{G_n},B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists c,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(c,B,\\tau_B,G_n,\\tau_{G_n})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(c\\circ b,\\operatorname{id}_{G_n},G_n,\\tau_{G_n},G_n,\\tau_{G_n})\n\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(b\\circ c,\\operatorname{id}_B,B,\\tau_B,B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}_S\n(h,T_n,\\pi_n^0,\\tau_{T_n},E,\\pi,\\tau_E,G_n,\\tau_{G_n},B,\\tau_B,b,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UniversalComplexBundleModel}_S(B,\\tau_B,E,\\pi,\\tau_E,n,b)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E,\\pi,B,\\tau_E,\\tau_B,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(b,G_n,\\tau_{G_n},B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists c,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(c,B,\\tau_B,G_n,\\tau_{G_n})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(c\\circ b,\\operatorname{id}_{G_n},G_n,\\tau_{G_n},G_n,\\tau_{G_n})\n\\land\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(b\\circ c,\\operatorname{id}_B,B,\\tau_B,B,\\tau_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{BundlePullbackIsomorphism}_S\n(h,T_n,\\pi_n^0,\\tau_{T_n},E,\\pi,\\tau_E,G_n,\\tau_{G_n},B,\\tau_B,b,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>丛拉回的载体、投影和拓扑均是实际集合及函数图；纤维线性由既定的源、目标运算检查。</li>\n<li>分类空间允许保持既有模型，只要求提供与显式 Grassmann 模型的同伦等价及其典范丛比较同构，不要求两个模型的载体字面相同。</li>\n<li>三元丛同构兼容接口的固定记录族明确了原先隐含的投影和拓扑；显式拉回同构谓词则逐项携带全部这些数据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-complex-vector-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"2bc9d494c7bff68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e5fc9ff70d8260ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E,F,X,Y,B,\\pi,q,\\tau_E,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\tau_B,h,f,b,n\\in V$。所有复向量丛采用 [[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]] 的固定纤维运算族，标量域为具有标准运算的 $\\mathbb C$。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e5fc9ff70d8260ec","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G_n,T_n,\\tau_{G_n},\\tau_{T_n},\\pi_n^0$ 来自 [[58-df-complex-grassmannian-data.md]]。该族中 $(\\pi_n^0)^{-1}[\\{P\\}]$ 的运算固定为 $\\langle P,v\\rangle+\\langle P,w\\rangle=\\langle P,v+w\\rangle$、$a\\odot\\langle P,v\\rangle=\\langle P,av\\rangle$；等式按该纤维的所有 $v,w,a$ 全称量化。这些运算不由候选比较映射重选。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}$ 取 [[58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"2bc9d494c7bff68e","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{LinIso}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed"